  << /ActualText (Testler development \366ncesinde yaln1zca yaz1lmaz\054 \347al1\137t1r1l1p beklenen nedenle ba\137ar1s1z oldu\037u do\037rulan1r\056\n\nDo\037ru d\366ng\374\072\nKabul kriterleri \n\222 Testleri yaz \n\222 Testleri \347al1\137t1r\072 RED \n\222 Development \n\222 Testleri tekrar \347al1\137t1r\072 GREEN \n\222 Refactor \n\222 Regresyon testi\n\n\nTDD yakla\1371m\056\n\n\nG\374ncellenmi\137 y\366nerge\072\nTEST FIRST KURALI  \n1\056 Development ba\137lamadan \366nce kabul kriterlerine kar\1371l1k gelen otomatik testler yaz1l1r\056 \n2\056 Her kabul kriteri en az bir testle e\137le\137tirilir\072 kapsam \045100\056 \n3\056 Testler development \366ncesinde \347al1\137t1r1l1r\056 \n4\056 Yeni testlerin beklenen nedenle ba\137ar1s1z oldu\037u do\037rulan1r\072 RED\056 \n5\056 RED kan1t1 olmadan Coding Agent \347al1\137amaz\056 \n6\056 Coding Agent\054 testleri ge\347irecek minimum kodu geli\137tirir\056 \n7\056 Yeni testler ve mevcut regresyon testleri yeniden \347al1\137t1r1l1r\056 \n8\056 T\374m testler ge\347meden g\366rev tamamlanamaz\072 GREEN\056 \n9\056 Coding Agent testleri silemez\054 atlayamaz veya zay1flatamaz\056 \n10\056 En fazla 6 d\374zeltme d\366ng\374s\374 sonunda h\342l\342 ba\137ar1s1zsa g\366rev BLOCKED olur\056\n\nAgent ak1\1371\072\nTest Agent\072 \nTestleri yazar ve RED\031i do\037rular \n\222 Coding Agent\072 Development yapar \n\222 Test Agent\057CI\072 GREEN\031i do\037rular \n\222 QA Agent\072 Regresyon ve kabul kontrol\374 yapar\n\nK1sacas1\072 \326nce test yaz1l1r ve ba\137ar1s1zl1\0371 do\037rulan1r\073 sonra development yap1l1r\073 ard1ndan testler ge\347ene kadar kod d\374zeltilir\056)
